<rt>とど</rt></ruby>けさせていただくことが<ruby>出来<rt>でき</rt></ruby>て<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです🎶</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">そして、<ruby>藤<rt>ふじ</rt></ruby>嶌<ruby>果歩<rt>かほ</rt></ruby>とICE DE BREAKERSやってます。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>新<rt>しん</rt></ruby><ruby>生活<rt>せいかつ</rt></ruby>、<ruby>緊張<rt>きんちょう</rt></ruby>するよね。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">そんな<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>こそアイスボックス<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べよ？</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">これ<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>美味<rt>おい</rt></ruby>しすぎて<ruby>学生<rt>がくせい</rt></ruby><ruby>時代<rt>じだい</rt></ruby>よく<ruby>友達<rt>ともだち</rt></ruby>と<ruby>帰<rt>かえ</rt></ruby>りに<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べてました！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>夏<rt>なつ</rt></ruby>には<ruby>暑<rt>あつ</rt></ruby>い<ruby>帰り道<rt>かえりみち</rt></ruby><ruby>友達<rt>ともだち</rt></ruby>とベンチに<ruby>座<rt>すわ</rt></ruby>って<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたなぁ…カリカリ<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べるの<ruby>幸<rt>しあわ</rt></ruby>せだったなぁ</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">なぁーんて<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>いながら<ruby>撮影<rt>さつえい</rt></ruby>していただきました！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">WEB CMにも<ruby>初<rt>はつ</rt></ruby><ruby>挑戦<rt>ちょうせん</rt></ruby>でとっても<ruby>面白<rt>おもしろ</rt></ruby>く<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>い<ruby>作品<rt>さくひん</rt></ruby>を<ruby>作<rt>つく</rt></ruby>っていただけたかと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><span dir=\"ltr\">4<ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>1<ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby></span>から<ruby>順次<rt>じゅんじ</rt></ruby><ruby>公開<rt>こうかい</rt></ruby>ですのでぜひご<ruby>確認<rt>かくにん</rt></ruby>くださいね！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/shogenji.yoko/2024-03-25/55220_1.jpg\" id=\"8FB74FC7-EC7A-40B5-B161-2E804EFB7F23\" aria-label=\"Mail.messageViewer.inlineAttachment.beauty_1706075796463.jpeg\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>撮影<rt>さつえい</rt></ruby><ruby>中<rt>ちゅう</rt></ruby>…</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/shogenji.yoko/2024-03-25/55220_2.jpg\" id=\"EF387F47-DBD9-4AA3-BEF0-0A94470E03EA\" aria-label=\"Mail.messageViewer.inlineAttachment.beauty_1706075810502.jpeg\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" alt=\"\"